WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.031
Positive curvature, ruled out.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.546
Positive scalar curvature makes small balls smaller.

3
00:00:05.546 --> 00:00:07.899
Aspherical spaces should never allow it.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.978
Reshape the metric circle by circle, until a known obstruction finally breaks.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.903
Claimed: true in every dimension, spin or not.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.544
Not in Lean.
